{
  "$description": "The hifi character (design language section 19): home hi-fi of the brushed-champagne and walnut kind. Warm champagne aluminium caps with polished chrome rings, levers and bezels, oiled-walnut (light) and black-lacquer (dark) plates, a warm dial-lamp glow, a wide bright soft room, heavy slow springs with soft detents, a chunky pointer and a muted, soft sound set. A sparse validated theme layer: it sets only what differs from premium. Its values are the I5 tuning on the prototype page (look sign-off pending with the owner); `provisional` names every one of them but the role assignments.",
